  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNICEF to Support on strengthening of Child Health</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&#x2018;Strengthening child health and nutrition, child protection and education systems in Cabo Delgado&#x2019; project, aims to save lives, alleviate suffering, and maintain human dignity through the provision of emergency multi-sectoral support to children and their caregivers in Cabo Delgado.  The objectives of the grant are to improve access to services of child health and nutrition, child protection, and education, and ensuring that child protection cases receive appropriate responses.  The key activities are focused on the following main areas: Child Health and Nutrition, Child Protection, Education, Accountability to Affected Populations/PSEA, and Humanitarian Cluster Coordination</narrative>
  </description>
